      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "AI cost is not exported as a metric. View cost estimates on the application's AI Processing page. Token counts alone cannot determine cost because model pricing, caching and service tier differ. Cached input tokens are a subset of input tokens; do not add them to input when calculating total usage."
